# Routine "Daily spend and performance check": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: Every weekday morning, checks the newest ad numbers against your thresholds and flags what broke, with the one change to make on each urgent line.
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/fuse && pi -p "/daily-spend-check"
